g and contribution docs.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 6 out of 6 changed files in this pull request and generated 5 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `test/testutil/latestlib.go` | Adds helpers for discovering direct module dependencies and bumping them to latest versions. |\r\n| `test/latestlibbuild/latestlibbuild_test.go` | Adds the new compile-only test that iterates over apps under `test/apps/`. |\r\n| `Makefile` | Adds `test-latestlibbuild` and cleans its log artifact. |\r\n| `docs/testing.md` | Documents LatestLibBuild as a fourth test category and explains expected failure handling. |\r\n| `CONTRIBUTING.md` | Adds the new make target to contributor-facing test commands. |\r\n| `.github/workflows/test-latestlibbuild.yaml` | Adds the dedicated CI workflow and required-status pattern for LatestLibBuild. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/464#pullrequestreview-4232896123","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/464","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/464#pullrequestreview-4232896123"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrument